<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (We have used Cummings & Co. for three house sales. Each time the experience has been wonderful. They are consummate professionals in addition to being lovely, caring people. We trust them to give us the best advice based on their deep knowledge of the market. Cummings & Co. have always gone above and beyond the call of duty in making our transactions easy and our choices profitable. John & Hayden C.)
